# Submission checklist: Agents on Open Rails

Submissions close Monday, November 9 at 9:00 AM GMT. Before you submit, make sure your entry on Loops (https://www.loops.house/agents-on-open-rails/) has:

✅ Your project entry with a link to its GitHub public repo
✅ Your agent’s wallet added to your entry
✅ ERC-8004 identity registered from that same wallet
✅ Attribution tag on every transaction (LatAm and Textile FX tracks)
✅ Your PayTo wallet (USA₮ with x402 track)
✅ The buy services your agent calls, with proof of payment, plus a simple frontend (Build with buy track)

Submit early so you have time to double-check everything.

Good luck, builders!

